 # Schedule synthetic receive turn safely after agent_end
 
 When tattler_receive has requested delivery and pending inbox is non-empty, defer until the session is idle before triggering a synthetic receive turn. Avoid reentrancy from inside awaited agent_end listeners; use an idle/zero-timeout helper. The synthetic turn must drain through the same before_agent_start path as user-resume turns.
 
